sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant DB
    participant Stream as DynamoDB Streams
    participant Relay as Relay Lambda
    participant Bus as EventBridge

    App->>DB: TransactWrite user + outbox
    DB-->>App: Atomic commit
    DB->>Stream: INSERT outbox item
    Stream->>Relay: New image
    Relay->>Bus: put_events with event_id
    Note over Relay,Bus: At-least-once; consumers dedupe on event_id
